00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.500
C'mon.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.160
At least let me eat my tofu...

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.530
Hey, look.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:09.440
The killer?

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.200
What?!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.940
That hit the spot.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.440
You bastard!

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.000
You little-!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.540
Hold it, punk!

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.720
Just leave Risette to me.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:25.620
You're coming with me!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.450
Ow, ow, ow!

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.260
Narukami, watch her.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.090
Me?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.590
Wait, dammit! I'm gonna pummel ya!

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:38.030
You can't! It'll be the police's fault
if the suspect gets hurt!

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.960
What's going on?

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:53.450
Wh-what are you doing?!
I'm just your typical Risette-loving civilian.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.810
You're hardly "typical" after murdering people!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.790
Murder? What are you talking about?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.690
Save it for the station!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.490
I didn't...
Save it for the station!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:05.960
Whoo! I've always wanted to say that!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.720
Now get up!

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:11.520
I appreciate your help in apprehending the killer.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.360
Go on! Keep up the pace!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.930
So it's all over now?

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.810
The case is solved? Boo-yeah!

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.300
But he could just be a fan...

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:27.380
Did I get kidnapped by a wimp like that?

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.010
No way.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.550
Is it safe here?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.550
We can see if someone's coming
from any direction.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:42.030
I'm used to having stalkers...

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.690
Wouldn't it be better if you weren't?

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:49.400
Rise Kujikawa

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:58.510
Rise's
Perfect
Body!!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.040
Waiting
for that
special
glance
back
at you.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:10.820
The girl everyone makes such a fuss over
isn't the real me.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:14.360
Risette, huh?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.830
That's just an idol made up to sell.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:31.210
No one sees the real me...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.090
Impressive!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:50.690
You suck.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.290
That hurts!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.970
Sorry.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.530
Look! I can do it if I try.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.240
That's cute!

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:13.180
Text 0557
Yosuke Hanamura
The Killer (?) Has Been Caught
The killer (?) has been caught.
Hurry on back with Risette.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.860
Looks like the coast's clear.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:21.630
Okay. It's getting dark out, so let's go.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.260
You never told me your name.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.000
Yu Narukami.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.130
I'm Rise Kujikawa.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.760
I heard on the news last night.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.150
Analog

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.890
The Midnight Channel last night...

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:57.670
Yeah. I caught I glimpse of her in the store
when I passed by this morning.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.600
It looks like the variety show only starts up
once they've entered the TV.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:07.040
Didn't we discuss how the person inside
the TV could be producing the show?

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.010
They could be subconsciously
showing us their inner thoughts.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:14.640
But then what's up with the fuzzy program
that comes on before they go missing?

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.650
It could be the killer's warning.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:22.150
But who's he warning? And why?

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.260
Ask the culprit.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:30.360
Is it possible that what the killer is thinking
is being aired, so it looks like a warning?

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.230
So we're seeing who he's
bent on targeting next?

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:39.230
Are you saying it's his fantasies of
"I'm gonna attack you!"

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:43.240
Wouldn't that mean that pervert
from earlier wasn't our guy?

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:47.510
All we know for sure is that
Rise Kujikawa is in danger.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:58.990
Kujikawa?

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.220
Oh, Narukami!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:03.970
Starting up school today?

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.940
I'm transferring to one of their
first year classes.

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:08.540
I'm here to file the paperwork.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.640
I see.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.410
That shoe box is yours?

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.270
Yeah, it's for second years.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:16.380
So you're my senpai.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.240
Be sure to show me the ropes, Narukami.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.010
I just transferred here last April myself.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.490
They weren't here when I arrived.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.730
I wonder how they heard about this.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.190
Let's take a different route.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:39.060
No Trespassers
Allowed on
School Campus

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.670
This is like a TV drama.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.300
Pretty cool, huh?

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.970
D aid ara

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.540
We can't sneak through...

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:58.710
Rise!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.220
Mr. Inoue?

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:03.790
Tatsuhime
Shrine

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.030
Tatsuhime
Shrine
What brought you here?

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:10.570
I couldn't go along with this
as your manager, Rise Kujikawa.

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:12.930
I'm not an idol anymore!

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:16.060
I'm not some doll that needs someone
to manage her time for her.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.240
About that movie where you were
given the starring role...

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:25.080
Are you trying to force me to perform again?

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.150
Just go.

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:30.810
Kanami has taken your role.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.820
Kanami? Kanami Mashita?

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:40.760
I'm going to back Kanami up
to the best of my abilities.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:50.900
Are you okay?

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.480
Are you sure you aren't deceiving yourself?

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:58.000
What would you know?!

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:01.580
Like you know a damn thing!

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:06.590
You're just like everyone else.

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:14.500
no time to waste

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:15.160
but make you pace

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:17.030
it's OK to remove copy and paste

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:17.970
I'm doing my way

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:18.900
you do it your way

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:20.570
don't just follow your left find the right way

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:21.270
stereotypes

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.140
too many hypes

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:23.970
but I'm the epitome of new types

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:25.640
having the fear is power to my soul

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:26.640
cuz I overcome them

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:27.410
that's how I roll

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:29.010
expose your thoughts

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:32.550
don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:35.070
rules prevailing in

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:39.750
that may be your greatest rival

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:44.760
believe in faith and your heart

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:47.830
your true soul stop being

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:50.470
in the shades come on

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:53.870
out in the open sun

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:59.910
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.310
delightful days

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:08.420
are with rich density of love

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:10.010
thorny path

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:15.280
there's no easy way for real bliss

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:18.460
so I keep on fighting for

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:23.260
beauty of destiny

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.800
Don't jump into this just for some fun.

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.030
Eh?

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.740
If you aren't careful, you could get hurt.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.210
If you're gonna play, do it elsewhere.

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:43.720
Okay...

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:47.710
Err, I'm sorry.

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:49.460
Are you fighting again?

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:53.190
It's nothing. Don't worry about it.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:01.470
Analog

00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:03.170
Analog
Maru-Q!

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:04.160
Analog

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.390
There's a bunch of Risettes?

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:22.420
Why does this feel so strange?

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:24.290
No, you're wrong!

00:24:24.490 --> 00:24:25.690
My glasses! My glasses!

00:24:25.860 --> 00:24:27.660
What the heck?!

00:24:27.800 --> 00:24:30.200
Goodbye forever.
